ad/t_thumb/scv1id.jpg"}, {"id": 1448255, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scv1hb.jpg"}, {"id": 1448256, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scv1hc.jpg"}, {"id": 1898748, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc14p30.jpg"}, {"id": 1915018, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc151my.jpg"}, {"id": 1915019, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc151mz.jpg"}, {"id": 1915020, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc151n0.jpg"}, {"id": 1915021, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc151n1.jpg"}], "slug": "the-blood-of-dawnwalker", "storyline": "14th-century Europe.\nBloody conflicts sweep the lands, and the Black Death comes for the survivors. It's a moment of weakness - and that's all they needed.\nVampires seize their opportunity. They walk out of the shadows and claim what they've been denied for centuries: freedom, and power that comes with it. Other creatures of the night follow their lead. Legends turn into reality, and history as we know it will never be the same.\nA young man turned into a Dawnwalker, forever treading the line between the world of day and the realm of night. Fight for your humanity or embrace the cursed powers to save your family. Whatever your choice, the question stands: is your soul worth the lives of those you love?", "summary": "The Blood of Dawnwalker is an open-world dark fantasy action RPG set in 14th-century Europe. You play as Coen, human by day and vampire by night, fighting to save your family in a story shaped by your actions and the secrets you uncover.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/the-blood-of-dawnwalker", "videos": [{"id": 135758, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "eeH0HMqd9VY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eeH0HMqd9VY", "title": "The Blood of Dawnwalker \u2014 Title Reveal & Game Reveal Event Announcement